{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Roll Summons a New Surprise!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re trapped. The house groans around you. Cold. Dark. On the table sits a 1970s board game \u2013 dusty but humming with energy. You\u2019d heard rumours, of course. About the board, the house. You look to your friends, and a voice, whimsical yet bitter, speaks: <i>\u201cLet\u2019s play a game.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a beloved toy, the Gamemaster now rules this abandoned house. Escape is possible \u2013 but only if you play. You roll the dice, and anotherworldly sound echoes through the house. Will you win your freedom or be dragged into the darkness?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beat the Gamemaster</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game and survive the unpredictable terrors, traps, and curses that are summoned. Reach the end and you\u2019ll escape. Perhaps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Fear Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op with up to 4 players. Work together\u2026 or leave someone behind. Death is not always the end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore to Find Dice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the house to recover the dice hidden within. Each can only be used once \u2013 choose wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Dice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some dice offer powers to heal, hide, or hinder those who hunt you, but nothing comes without risk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Try Not to Get Lost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house is a labyrinth of rooms. Lose your way, and you may never make it back to the board.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fear-filled Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a co-op psychological horror, built around a cursed game that is desperate to be played.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face bizarre, unique creatures \u2013 each with their own way of hunting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps, curses, and chaos await every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house has different biomes \u2013 jungle, ice mountain, oversized toy chest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive to earn rewards\u2026 and unlock more formidable challenges. Will you play again?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come, friends, and play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live or die, who could say?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883570?t=1757952496","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/b7d9d801623ed57b88eb75f5b1a938126cf1b29c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757952496","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/5af07df8afce5c9e5feb755c2b47a277f679399a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757952496","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/5af07df8afce5c9e5feb755c2b47a277f679399a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757952496","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Roll Summons a New Surprise!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re trapped. The house groans around you. Cold. Dark. On the table sits a 1970s board game \u2013 dusty but humming with energy. You\u2019d heard rumours, of course. About the board, the house. You look to your friends, and a voice, whimsical yet bitter, speaks: <i>\u201cLet\u2019s play a game.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a beloved toy, the Gamemaster now rules this abandoned house. Escape is possible \u2013 but only if you play. You roll the dice, and anotherworldly sound echoes through the house. Will you win your freedom or be dragged into the darkness?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beat the Gamemaster</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game and survive the unpredictable terrors, traps, and curses that are summoned. Reach the end and you\u2019ll escape. Perhaps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Fear Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op with up to 4 players. Work together\u2026 or leave someone behind. Death is not always the end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore to Find Dice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the house to recover the dice hidden within. Each can only be used once \u2013 choose wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Dice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some dice offer powers to heal, hide, or hinder those who hunt you, but nothing comes without risk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Try Not to Get Lost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house is a labyrinth of rooms. Lose your way, and you may never make it back to the board.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fear-filled Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a co-op psychological horror, built around a cursed game that is desperate to be played.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face bizarre, unique creatures \u2013 each with their own way of hunting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps, curses, and chaos await every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house has different biomes \u2013 jungle, ice mountain, oversized toy chest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive to earn rewards\u2026 and unlock more formidable challenges. Will you play again?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come, friends, and play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live or die, who could say?</strong></p>","developers":["Ludogram"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/b9bce7d335990895ca86f9091571a3a576c8fd45/header.jpg?t=1757952496","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257175338,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175338/movie480.mp4?t=1755298189","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175338/movie_max.mp4?t=1755298189"},"name":"Invokyr - Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175338/d37162af9682a890b5305fd7b8d9d7482a2eeea3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755298189","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175338/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755298189","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175338/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755298189"}}],"name":"Invokyr","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> TBA</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> TBA</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Ludogram"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/